{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（12日）上午7時許，新蒲崗衍慶街近彩虹道發生交通意外，一輛七人車與一輛Tesla相撞，其中七人車再剷上行人路撞欄杆，事件中一名司機報稱胸口不適。</p><p>現場消息指，事發時，七人車由小路右轉出衍慶街，讓處劃有讓線；而Tesla由衍慶街往彩虹道方向行駛，其間兩車相撞，七人車繼而剷上右邊行人路，撞毀路邊鐵欄，遺下一地沙石，車頭嚴重損毀。Tesla則右邊車身凹陷，男司機報稱胸口不適，需要送院治理。</p><figure><img alt=\"七人車由小路讓線駛出衍慶街，Tesla由衍慶街駛出彩虹道，兩車於交界位置相撞。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260612/1142038875225460736712305.jpeg/IrwWY5qylxt4UpXY0jPTEaWchKV9ydDFz3y6yM98usg\"/><figcaption>七人車由小路讓線駛出衍慶街，Tesla由衍慶街駛出彩虹道，兩車於交界位置相撞。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"黑色七人車剷上行人路。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260612/1142035869218115584172385.jpeg/OcLgMS6cHTqc07QldHOv-oxRhvcFQeVmJ18R-SdfEfk\"/><figcaption>黑色七人車剷上行人路。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防到場救援。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260612/1142035871541891072014368.jpeg/kNLnPKudgc99aBh7gm7ckbAPoqnrdWQ7O5_GVzufxlc\"/><figcaption>消防到場救援。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"七人車車頭損毀，碎片散落一地。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260612/1142035873702088704085642.jpeg/4-FNYOxB_Unc3TJO8DbvLQOvsYP1cKaBaUY7-WlGO_k\"/><figcaption>七人車車頭損毀，碎片散落一地。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"七人車剷上行人路。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260612/1142035875962949632736420.jpeg/kNZwFhrIA1LCwFepvxVHKPdrMrKAsJn38vau-PL2rvg\"/><figcaption>七人車剷上行人路。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Tesla右邊車身損毀。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260612/1142035878198644736348751.jpeg/Yse5n6TyFoz9Ev2T_8cEvaLHZ7AbY-qs58Z9aufGfWo\"/><figcaption>Tesla右邊車身損毀。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"交通警員在場調查。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260612/1142035869016788992106475.jpeg/f5UasCa786hwhPyETeVQuAC-6NBwOkKL7YFaye2BWsk\"/><figcaption>交通警員在場調查。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防陪同傷者離開。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260612/1142035871407673344280751.jpeg/frqtWcGXpV6sRSFj1W6aRK7-QBGfR5WZ-V9LO_lfSzs\"/><figcaption>消防陪同傷者離開。</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-12T02:01:58.112507+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":315,"images":8,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}